<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  org.nextbsd.cupsd.plist

  launchd job for the CUPS scheduler (Apple's CUPS 2.3.4, cups-522.4),
  adapted from Apple's org.cups.cupsd.plist. Installed by
  nextbsd-printing-support into /System/Library/LaunchDaemons.

  Socket activation, as on macOS: launchd owns the local socket
  /var/run/cupsd (the "Listeners" entry) and starts cupsd when a client
  connects. `cupsd -l` collects that socket with launch_activate_socket()
  (liblaunch, nextbsd-userland#447), then exits by itself after
  IdleExitTimeout (60 s by default) once it has no jobs, no shared printers
  to advertise and no clients; the next connection starts it again. The
  TCP listener (localhost:631 from cupsd.conf) is opened by cupsd while it
  runs, as on macOS.

  Apple's plist keeps cupsd running through KeepAlive/PathState on the file
  cupsd writes while it has work (/var/spool/cups/cache/org.cups.cupsd).
  NextBSD's launchd doesn't act on PathState, so this job doesn't use it.
  RunAtLoad does that job instead: cupsd starts once when the job loads at
  boot, resumes any queued jobs and advertises shared printers, and stays
  only while it has work; otherwise it exits after the idle timeout. There
  is no KeepAlive: if cupsd stops for any reason, launchd keeps the socket
  and the next client starts it again, so a failing cupsd never loops.

  Apple's CUPS_DEBUG_* environment and the macOS-only keys (ProcessType,
  EnableTransactions, TransactionTimeLimitEnabled) are dropped.

  Nothing goes to the console: cupsd logs to /var/log/cups/ (ErrorLog,
  AccessLog, PageLog in cups-files.conf), and anything it writes to
  stdout/stderr goes to /var/log/cupsd.stderr, like the other daemons'
  *.stderr files.

  SockPathMode 49663 is 0140777 (a socket, mode 0777), as in Apple's plist:
  any local user may connect; cupsd.conf's policies decide what they may do.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>org.nextbsd.cupsd</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/usr/sbin/cupsd</string>
		<string>-l</string>
	</array>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>ExitTimeOut</key>
	<integer>60</integer>
	<key>Sockets</key>
	<dict>
		<key>Listeners</key>
		<array>
			<dict>
				<key>SockPathName</key>
				<string>/var/run/cupsd</string>
				<key>SockPathMode</key>
				<integer>49663</integer>
			</dict>
		</array>
	</dict>
	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>/var/log/cupsd.stderr</string>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>/var/log/cupsd.stderr</string>
</dict>
</plist>
